cdk.out
lib
dist
release

# go-task's local up-to-date cache: one file per task holding a hash of its
# `sources:` globs. Per-machine, rewritten on every build, meaningless to anyone
# else's checkout. Was tracked until 2026-08-23, which made every build dirty the
# working tree and produced conflicts on files nobody reads.
.task/
gitversion.out
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
packages/mailbox-cdk-shared/tsconfig.build.tsbuildinfo

# Build outputs and local dev files
.jsii
build.log
/build
.github/copilot-instructions.md

# Artifact versions are regenerated by resolve-artifacts before being read
/artifact-versions.json
packages/mailbox/artifact-versions.json
